<section class="card">
  <h2>About This Site</h2>
  <p>
    This project was developed for my CST336 course as an enhanced, 
    modern version of my original HW1 baseball website. Rebuilt using
    Express and EJS, the site now incorporates real MLB data through a
    Web API and dynamic server-side rendering, giving each page a more
    interactive and data-driven feel.
  </p>
  <p>
    I created this project to combine two things I care deeply about: 
    baseball and technology. My goal was to build a site that not only 
    displays live information, but also captures some of the excitement 
    and personality of the game itself.
  </p>
  <p>
    Thank you for visiting. I hope you enjoy exploring the data as much as
    I enjoyed building the project. - Alexis Wogoman
  </p>
</section>

